@startuml
[*] --> Greeting : User Arrives
Greeting --> Idle : System Is Idle Again
Idle --> Card Inserted : Card Inserted
Card Inserted --> PIN Verified : Correct PIN Entered
Card Inserted --> Invalid PIN : Incorrect PIN Entered
PIN Verified --> Options Displayed : PIN Correct
Options Displayed --> Request Processing : User Selects an Option
Invalid PIN --> Return Card : User Cancels Operation
Invalid PIN --> Idle : Invalid Card or Too Many Incorrect Attempts
Request Processing --> [*] : Transaction Complete

@enduml
